Terminals unused in grammar

    FUNCTION


Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: DeclList StmtList

    2 DeclList: ε
    3         | VarDecl DeclList
    4         | FuncDecl DeclList

    5 VarDeclList: ε
    6            | VarDecl VarDeclList

    7 VarDecl: TYPE ID SEMI
    8        | ARRAY TYPE ID LBRACKET INT_NUMBER RBRACKET SEMI

    9 FuncDecl: TYPE ID LPAREN ParamList RPAREN LBRACE VarDeclList StmtList RBRACE

   10 ParamList: ε
   11          | Param
   12          | Param COMMA ParamList

   13 Param: TYPE ID

   14 StmtList: ε
   15         | Stmt StmtList

   16 Stmt: ID ASSIGN Expr SEMI
   17     | ID LBRACKET Expr RBRACKET ASSIGN Expr SEMI
   18     | WRITE ID SEMI
   19     | FuncCall SEMI

   20 Expr: Expr PLUS Expr
   21     | Expr MINUS Expr
   22     | Expr MULTIPLY Expr
   23     | Expr DIVIDE Expr
   24     | ID
   25     | ID LBRACKET Expr RBRACKET
   26     | INT_NUMBER
   27     | FLOAT_NUMBER
   28     | FuncCall

   29 FuncCall: ID LPAREN ArgList RPAREN

   30 ArgList: ε
   31        | Arg
   32        | Arg COMMA ArgList

   33 Arg: Expr


